OL,3,GNEWSAUlez concerns on London border
OL,4,Athree years on
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree years after London's Ultra Low
OL,7,FEmission Zone (Ulez) expanded across
OL,8,Fthe capital, businesses and residents
OL,9,Fon the border of the scheme have said
OL,10,Fstrong feelings remain, although many
OL,11,Fhave adapted.
OL,13,FUlez expanded to cover all London
OL,14,Fboroughs on 29 August 2023, which put
OL,15,Fareas such as Dartford and Swanley in
OL,16,FKent, and Epsom and Staines in Surrey
OL,17,Fon the edge of the zone.
OL,19,FBusinesses on both sides of the zone
OL,20,Fdescribed the difficulties some
OL,21,Fcustomers faced from the #12.50 daily
OL,22,Fcharge and said complaints remain.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
